<title>USA: Nashua eyeing Euro photofinish alternatives.</title>
<headline>Nashua eyeing Euro photofinish alternatives.</headline>
<dateline>NASHUA, N.H. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nashua Corp said on Thursday that performance of its mainland European businesses continues to be below last year.</p>
<p>The company indicated that it is continuing to evaluate alternatives for its European photofinishing operations, which could result in charges of up to $3 million in the fourth quarter of 1996.</p>
</text>
